1:11:30
1 Stunde, 11 Minuten, 30 Sekunden
and carries a suite of scientific instruments that would fill a small laboratory. It can analyze rock
1:11:37
1 Stunde, 11 Minuten, 37 Sekunden
composition, detect organic molecules, and drill into stone. All controlled
