receiving high-level commands and then navigating and making momentto- moment decisions on its own. And then there's
1:12:07
1 Stunde, 12 Minuten, 7 Sekunden
the cannid arm, the robotic arm on the International Space Station and its successors. The original cannid arm was installed on the space shuttle in 1981.
1:12:18
1 Stunde, 12 Minuten, 18 Sekunden
