the mid 2020s, Intuitive Surgical had installed over 9,000 Da Vinci systems worldwide, and they'd been used in over
1:15:52
1 Stunde, 15 Minuten, 52 Sekunden
12 million procedures. prostatctomies, hysterctomies, heart valve repairs, kidney surgery. The robot has become a
1:16:02
1 Stunde, 16 Minuten, 2 Sekunden
standard tool in modern surgery and the next generation of surgical robots is beginning to incorporate AI assisted
1:16:09
