nerves or vessels and eventually perhaps perform certain standardized portions of a procedure autonomously. So, robots
1:16:27
1 Stunde, 16 Minuten, 27 Sekunden
excel in space and surgery environments where precision matters enormously, where the stakes are high, and where the
1:16:35
1 Stunde, 16 Minuten, 35 Sekunden
conditions, while challenging, are at least somewhat structured and predictable. The much harder problem is the unstructured environment. The home,
1:16:44
1 Stunde, 16 Minuten, 44 Sekunden
the city street, the random warehouse where nothing is where you expect it to be and the rules keep changing. And
1:16:52
1 Stunde, 16 Minuten, 52 Sekunden
that's where the story of self-driving cars comes in. The story of mobile robots that really changed the field
