5.026 Aufrufe  06.08.2026
Now streaming on Spotify 
https://open.spotify.com/show/033FF4Y...

Discover the complete story of the periodic table—from ancient Greek theories and medieval alchemy to the experiments that transformed chemistry forever.

We explore the discoveries of Robert Boyle, Antoine Lavoisier, Dmitri Mendeleev, Henry Moseley, Glenn Seaborg, and many others who revealed the hidden structure of matter. Along the way, learn how the table predicts undiscovered elements, reflects quantum mechanics, and continues to evolve as scientists search for elements 119 and 120.

Resources

• IUPAC – Periodic Table of the Elements
https://iupac.org/what-we-do/periodic...

• Royal Society of Chemistry – History of the Periodic Table
https://periodic-table.rsc.org/history

• Royal Society of Chemistry – Development of the Periodic Table
https://periodic-table.rsc.org/about

• U.S. Department of Energy – Superheavy Elements
https://www.energy.gov/science/doe-ex...
