|--------|------|-------|
| EM relDrift | 6.440e-09 | MODEL |
| Klima kBar | 50.0 | GAME |
| Frieden pBar | 50.0 **B** | GAME (kein instant C) |
| liveCombos | 7/8 | GAME |
| best front | **ALL** | triadMean **87.0**, R_flow **27.0** |
| releaseScore | **65.218** | GAME |
| TRL | 6 | GAME (nicht NASA-zertifiziert) |
