2:44:322 Stunden, 44 Minuten, 32 SekundenEvery one of those rotors is locked to the same rhythm.
2:44:362 Stunden, 44 Minuten, 36 SekundenWhen you switched on the light in your room tonight, every one of them felt it.
2:44:422 Stunden, 44 Minuten, 42 SekundenA tiny extra weight shared among them all. And every one of them answered,
2:44:492 Stunden, 44 Minuten, 49 Sekunden"The frequency is holding at 60." The governors are making their small adjustments. The regulators are doing
2:44:572 Stunden, 44 Minuten, 57 Sekundentheir constant dance. Every rotor is holding its place. You can let it run.
