15:33
essentially ancient cooperatives, a merger of different organisms that learn to live as one. Understanding this
15:40
difference between proariots and ukarotes is not just academic trivia. It
15:46
is the foundation of modern medicine. It is the reason why you can take an antibiotic and survive. When you have a
15:53
