Thankyou for watching this animated summary of The Laws of Human Nature by Robert Greene. Please Subscribe :)
Robert Greene explores primitive forces governing human behavior, such as envy and grandiosity, which often operate beneath conscious awareness. Escaping Ordinary (B.C Marx) details strategies to recognize these patterns in yourself and others to better navigate social dynamics.
