22.916 Aufrufe  03.09.2026
Explore the laws of physics in a slow, relaxing journey through the ideas that helped us understand how the universe works. From Galileo, Kepler, and Newton to gravity, thermodynamics, entropy, electromagnetism, Maxwell’s equations, and Noether’s theorem, we follow the discoveries that revealed the hidden order behind nature.

We’ll also see why these classical laws are incredibly powerful but not the final word, as relativity and quantum mechanics reveal an even deeper picture of reality. Perfect for learning, relaxing, or falling asleep.

Resources:

OpenStax — Newton’s Laws & Forces
https://openstax.org/books/university...

OpenStax — Laws of Thermodynamics & Entropy
https://openstax.org/books/university...

OpenStax — Maxwell’s Equations & Electromagnetic Waves
https://openstax.org/books/university...

Einstein Online — General Relativity & Gravity
https://www.einstein-online.info/en/G...
