40.873 Aufrufe  09.06.2026
Drift off while learning the confusing basics of electricity, from voltage and current to resistance, circuits, batteries, and everyday electrical mysteries, explained slowly in a calm and relaxing way.
Cosmo Explains traces the history of electricity from ancient observations of amber to the invention of the voltaic pile. This exploration demystifies how early thinkers transitioned from studying static sparks to generating a steady current, uncovering the fundamental mechanisms behind this essential yet often misunderstood force.
