yet knows which approach will win. And the main enemy on the intensity frontier is one we haven't talked about yet.
2:47:40
2 Stunden, 47 Minuten, 40 Sekunden
Although it's been hiding inside every beam all night. Protons all have a positive charge, and like charges repel.
2:47:49
