2:52:28
2 Stunden, 52 Minuten, 28 Sekunden
almost everybody. And we've come a long way tonight. Let's walk back along the road slowly. We started with Rutherford,
2:52:37
2 Stunden, 52 Minuten, 37 Sekunden
