2:53:31
2 Stunden, 53 Minuten, 31 Sekunden
and it kept its perfect rhythm until Einstein's speed limit broke it. Vexler
2:53:37
2 Stunden, 53 Minuten, 37 Sekunden
and McMillan found that a wave chosen on the right slope can herd particles back into step gathering them into bunches.
2:53:47
2 Stunden, 53 Minuten, 47 Sekunden
Olphant and McMillan fixed the particles on a single circle with magnets rising in synchrony.
2:53:55
2 Stunden, 53 Minuten, 55 Sekunden
