learned to thread their machines through a spider's web of resonances, sometimes even dashing straight through it. And
2:54:18
2 Stunden, 54 Minuten, 18 Sekunden
then we followed one proton from a bottle of hydrogen through a linear accelerator, a booster, a grandparent
2:54:25
