synretron from 1959, a 4mm ring, and finally into the great ring under the mountains where it
2:54:32
2 Stunden, 54 Minuten, 32 Sekunden
circled 11,000 times a second before being destroyed on purpose so that its energy could become something new. So,
2:54:41
2 Stunden, 54 Minuten, 41 Sekunden
