2:54:48
2 Stunden, 54 Minuten, 48 Sekunden
electric fields rising and falling like waves and with particles timed to ride them. Why not just use a bigger battery?
2:54:57
2 Stunden, 54 Minuten, 57 Sekunden
Because one giant push turns into lightning and many small pushes don't. Why did the machines curl into circles?
2:55:06
2 Stunden, 55 Minuten, 6 Sekunden
